PetitTrack is a satellite tracker for the Sharp Zaurus SL-5000D and 
SL-5500 Linux PDA.

Release 1.1.0 

    * New feature: Sun and Moon positions and Sun terminator are now 
      displayed on the world map in the Tracker tab.
    * New feature: Astro tab to display the coordinates for the Sun and 
      Moon.
    * New feature: In addition to a full color map, a two color map is now 
      available.
    * Fixed a bug that prevented PetitTrack from starting when the 
      nasatle.txt file was replaced with a new one with fewer objects.
    * Fixed a bug in the month field in the Ephemeris tab.
    * Fixed a bug that caused PetitTrack to hang if the AOS/LOS times for 
      an object could not be determined.
    * Added more verbosity to the error message when the nasatle.txt file 
      could not be found.
    * Few UI changes and other minor improvements.


Screenshots and binary/source distribuition can be found at

http://www.qsl.net/n1vtn/

Feedback and bug reports are welcome.

